ost in — reached Cerulean City, and beat Misty for the Cascade Badge. Now you\'re after your third gym.. Next on my list: catch an pikachu around Viridian Forest (rare) / Power Plant later. It grows into my raichu — that\'s my answer for Lorelei AND Lance down the line. Grabbing it now, before I need it.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "VERMILION POK.MON GYM LEADER. LT. SURGE WINNING TRAINERS. GARY"; "I\'m a lightweight, but I\'m good with electricity! That\'s why I joined this GYM."; "Using CUT, you can chop down small trees. Why not try it with the trees around VERMILION CITY?"; "KIRA put the HM01 in the TM CASE.". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and head to Vermilion City for the Thunder Badge. Next: You CRUSHED Misty — ride the momentum: Lt. Surge in Vermilion City is NEXT (not fought yet); the trainers on the way are your training. Bigger picture: Reach Vermilion City, beat Lt. Surge for the Thunder Badge. Your team right now: wartortle (L33), caterpie the butterfree (L11), rattata (L14), spearow (L15), abra (L14), ekans (L13). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.', 'progress': "2 badge(s) earned (Boulder, Cascade). Next gym: Lt. Surge of Vermilion City. Pokédex: 9 caught. She's two badges down, a quarter of the way (of 8 badges, then the Elite Four).", 'party': 'wartortle (L33), caterpie the butterfree (L11), rattata (L14), spearow (L15), abra (L14), ekans (L13)', 'goal': {'short': "You're ready — stop grinding and head to Vermilion City for the Thunder Badge", 'medium': 'You CRUSHED Misty — ride the momentum: Lt. Surge in Vermilion City is NEXT (not fought yet); the trainers on the way are your training', 'long': 'Reach Vermilion City, beat Lt. Surge for the Thunder Badge'}} options=['head_to_gym', '